From ee8bef3cb315e1b90b00b3867881576728cb3ae5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z4rivers <zachary4rivers@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Mar 2026 17:05:51 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/68] feat(01-02): replace ChromaDB with pgvector in
 vector_db.py

- Rewrite VectorDBManager to use pgvector SQL via PostgresDB singleton
- Replace OpenAI/sentence-transformers with google-genai gemini-embedding-001
- All public method signatures preserved for backward compatibility
- Uses content_embeddings and property_embeddings tables with HNSW cosine search
- ChromaDB-style $in filter support maintained for existing callers

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
